{
  "$schema": "AEPS conformance vectors v0.1",
  "description": "AEPS §4 capability descriptor canonical hashing. The endpoint_id is the SHA-256 hex of the canonical-JSON serialization of the descriptor with the endpoint_id field stripped. Sorted-keys recursive (RFC 8785 subset). Both reference impls must produce identical canonical bytes + identical SHA-256.",
